From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nobody <>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 16:08:19 +1000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: map cudaDriverGetVersion for HIP builds

Patch 0015 (Ollama GPU discovery, b9509 port) calls cudaDriverGetVersion in
ggml_cuda_init; vendors/hip.h never mapped it, so every ROCm build failed with
'use of undeclared identifier cudaDriverGetVersion'. Found building ggml-hip
for gfx1100 (RX 7900 XTX).
---
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/vendors/hip.h | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/vendors/hip.h b/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/vendors/hip.h
index da7e3da0b..13fcdec9f 100644
--- a/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/vendors/hip.h
+++ b/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/vendors/hip.h
@@ -56,6 +56,7 @@
 #define cudaDeviceGetPCIBusId hipDeviceGetPCIBusId
 #define cudaDeviceProp hipDeviceProp_t
 #define cudaDeviceSynchronize hipDeviceSynchronize
+#define cudaDriverGetVersion hipDriverGetVersion
 #define cudaError_t hipError_t
 #define cudaErrorMemoryAllocation hipErrorOutOfMemory
 #define cudaErrorPeerAccessAlreadyEnabled hipErrorPeerAccessAlreadyEnabled
-- 
2.43.0

